  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya - Strengthening Regional Economic Integration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the pace of infrastructure development and enhance regional trade competitiveness, by delivering improvement to the managerial capacity and physical layout for cargo handling at the Port of Mombasa, and improved regulatory framework for trade. This will contribute to increased exports and regional trade in East Africa benefitting the regional population.</narrative>
  </description>
